            <ul class="p9-spec-list">
                <li><strong>Technology: Maxwell / KEMET ultracapacitor cells in series/parallel</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Voltage: 48V nominal bus</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Capacitance: 500F effective</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Charge/discharge: Millisecond response — absorbs generator spikes</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Cycle life: 1,000,000+ cycles — essentially wear-free</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Purpose: Buffers between generators and lithium pack</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Regen role: Captures hard-braking energy spikes instantly</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Location: Front bay — flat horizontal mounting beside radiator</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Weight: ~25 lbs for 500F / 48V module</strong></li>
            </ul>
