                <li><strong>Energy storage: 1 kWh usable kinetic energy</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Self-discharge: Near zero — magnetic bearing, vacuum housing</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Cycle life: Millions of cycles — no chemical degradation</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Charge mode: Generator surplus → motor-spins flywheel up</strong></li>
